<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Universal Adversarial Trigger method performance. Triggers are generated given claims from a source class to fool the classifier to predict a target class (column <span id="S4.T1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Class</span>, with SUPPORTS (S), REFUTES (R), NEI). The results are averaged over the top 10 triggers.</figcaption>
</figure>
